      "type": "text", "id": "title", "x": 110, "y": 40, "width": 760, "height": 40,
      "text": "Building Effective Agents · 复杂度阶梯", "originalText": "Building Effective Agents · 复杂度阶梯",
      "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0, "seed": 110001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110002, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "customData": { "step": 1, "stepLabel": "标题·中心论证" }
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "thesis1", "x": 110, "y": 92, "width": 940, "height": 24,
      "text": "核心论证：最成功的实现不靠复杂框架，而靠 simple, composable patterns —— 从「增强型 LLM」出发，按需逐级加复杂度。", "originalText": "核心论证：最成功的实现不靠复杂框架，而靠 simple, composable patterns —— 从「增强型 LLM」出发，按需逐级加复杂度。",
      "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0, "seed": 110003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110004, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "customData": { "step": 1 }
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "thesis2", "x": 110, "y": 120, "width": 820, "height": 22,
      "text": "地基分界：workflow = 预定义代码路径 (predefined code paths) · agent = 模型自定路径 (model-directed)。", "originalText": "地基分界：workflow = 预定义代码路径 (predefined code paths) · agent = 模型自定路径 (model-directed)。",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0, "seed": 110005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110006, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25,
